            "detailed_description": "An artistic metroidvania with a classic NES era gameplay, taking the player through the life of an average man escaping his depression in a partly imaginary world he created around him.<br>The game takes place in an old, still running business housing. Main character meets various different people on his path to find more happiness in his life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748880/extras/3ea80dd880c479ce9a712dd48c0f818d.avif?t=1541580369\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br>In each environment different types of enemies await to attack you, each with its own<br>strengths and patterns. Improve your tactics while fighting in either of the 3 difficulties.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748880/extras/6658232c7a819e3b91766a24a6d01f54.avif?t=1541580369\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br>Apart from it's attacking power, each power is equipped with a special ability that you<br>have to combine in order to make your way through the levels and uncover all the<br>secrets. Collect orbs to upgrade your powers for maximum efficiency in your fights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748880/extras/bf14e3da21afb7080a56ba8d97f6a48a.avif?t=1541580369\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br>At the end of each section of the building a powerful boss awaits to fight you.<br>Overcome your past and the fears that haunt you to regain your true self.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748880/extras/3fdbbc9f8c3f51815ae21c3f6b6efb98.avif?t=1541580369\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br>Buy items from the shops or obtain them from quests around the building.<br>Use them to unlock new areas and defeat all the enemies that block your way.",
