                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is incredible for being free. Its a good game, but not great. I really liked the puzzle aspect, but a few puzzles' rules weren't explained in any way and are more likely to be brute forced than finding the intended solution, such as the levers in the sewer. I still don't understand how I was meant to get the solution. Definitely do recommend it though. Keyboard controls are definitely not recommended.",
